{
    "title": "Preglife - Pregnancy Tracker",
    "description": "Welcome to Preglife: A midwife in your pocket\r\n\r\nExpecting a child, giving birth, and becoming a parent are among life's most significant changes, both physically and mentally. That's why we've developed the ultimate app for you, your child, and your potential partner, all to ensure you have a safe and well-informed time.\r\n\r\nAll content in the app is fact-checked by specialists. Preglife collaborates with an international network of midwives and doctors.\r\n\r\nPregnancy App\r\n\r\n\u25ba Personalized content about your pregnancy and your baby's development\r\n\u25ba Articles with detailed information about the baby in the womb, diet and nutrition during pregnancy, recommendations from the Public Health Agency regarding vaccines, and much more\r\n\u25ba 3 different podcasts with expert advice on childbirth and parenthood\r\n\u25ba Guides on important topics such as breastfeeding, car seats, insurance, and vaccinations\r\n\u25ba Partner category for tips and advice for the partner and activities to do together\r\n\r\nDuring your pregnancy\r\n\r\n\u25ba Pregnancy calendar - Follow your pregnancy and your baby's development week by week\r\n\u25ba Fruit comparison - Each new week of pregnancy displays a fruit or vegetable symbolizing the baby's size\r\n\u25ba Checklist - for everything important to remember\r\n\u25ba Contraction timer - Time contractions when the time comes\r\n\u25ba Vaccination guide - Keep track of recommended and free vaccines\r\n\u25ba Free online childbirth classes in Swedish and English\r\n\r\nExercise with Mumfulness - content created by experts for your well-being\r\n\r\nRegular exercise helps you feel good when you're expecting a child. In Mumfulness, you can access a wide range of safe and fun exercise sessions, yoga classes, and guided meditations that you can use during pregnancy and the first stages of parenthood.\r\n\r\nPreglife Connect\r\n\r\nDon't forget to download Preglife Connect, our app designed for parents like you to meet other parents.\r\n\r\nGood luck with your pregnancy and parenthood. We are with you every step of the way! Feel free to reach out if you have any questions or feedback: info@preglife.com.\r\n\r\n\u25ba Follow us on social media\r\n\u2022 Instagram: instagram.com/preglife\r\n\u2022 Facebook: facebook.com/preglife\r\n\r\n\u25ba See our terms and privacy policy:\r\n\u2022 Privacy policy: https://preglife.com/privacy-policy\r\n\u2022 Terms of use: https://preglife.com/user-agreement",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Preglife: A midwife in your pocket<br><br>Expecting a child, giving birth, and becoming a parent are among life&#39;s most significant changes, both physically and mentally. That&#39;s why we&#39;ve developed the ultimate app for you, your child, and your potential partner, all to ensure you have a safe and well-informed time.<br><br>All content in the app is fact-checked by specialists. Preglife collaborates with an international network of midwives and doctors.<br><br>Pregnancy App<br><br>\u25ba Personalized content about your pregnancy and your baby&#39;s development<br>\u25ba Articles with detailed information about the baby in the womb, diet and nutrition during pregnancy, recommendations from the Public Health Agency regarding vaccines, and much more<br>\u25ba 3 different podcasts with expert advice on childbirth and parenthood<br>\u25ba Guides on important topics such as breastfeeding, car seats, insurance, and vaccinations<br>\u25ba Partner category for tips and advice for the partner and activities to do together<br><br>During your pregnancy<br><br>\u25ba Pregnancy calendar - Follow your pregnancy and your baby&#39;s development week by week<br>\u25ba Fruit comparison - Each new week of pregnancy displays a fruit or vegetable symbolizing the baby&#39;s size<br>\u25ba Checklist - for everything important to remember<br>\u25ba Contraction timer - Time contractions when the time comes<br>\u25ba Vaccination guide - Keep track of recommended and free vaccines<br>\u25ba Free online childbirth classes in Swedish and English<br><br>Exercise with Mumfulness - content created by experts for your well-being<br><br>Regular exercise helps you feel good when you&#39;re expecting a child. In Mumfulness, you can access a wide range of safe and fun exercise sessions, yoga classes, and guided meditations that you can use during pregnancy and the first stages of parenthood.<br><br>Preglife Connect<br><br>Don&#39;t forget to download Preglife Connect, our app designed for parents like you to meet other parents.<br><br>Good luck with your pregnancy and parenthood. We are with you every step of the way! Feel free to reach out if you have any questions or feedback: info@preglife.com.<br><br>\u25ba Follow us on social media<br>\u2022 Instagram: instagram.com/preglife<br>\u2022 Facebook: facebook.com/preglife<br><br>\u25ba See our terms and privacy policy:<br>\u2022 Privacy policy: https://preglife.com/privacy-policy<br>\u2022 Terms of use: https://preglife.com/user-agreement",
